241 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H6
/P 69 0 R
/T (They won for his incredible discoveries of the macroscopic quantum mechanical tunnelling and energy quantisation in an electric circuit. They demonstrated that the bizarre properties of the quantum world can be made concrete in a system big enough to be held in the hand. Their superconducting electrical system could tunnel from one state to another, as if it were passing straight through a wall. They also showed that the system absorbed and emitted energy in doses of specific sizes, just as predicted by quantum mechanics.)
/E (They won for his incredible discoveries of the macroscopic quantum mechanical tunnelling and energy quantisation in an electric circuit. They demonstrated that the bizarre properties of the quantum world can be made concrete in a system big enough to be held in the hand. Their superconducting electrical system could tunnel from one state to another, as if it were passing straight through a wall. They also showed that the system absorbed and emitted energy in doses of specific sizes, just as predicted by quantum mechanics.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [11]
>>
endobj
