/Title (William Rees is also in Year 9 at Ashford School. Both he, and Jacob Navaratne founded The Catalyst. Will joined in Reception, and has gone through the school. He is Academic Scholar, Drama Scholar and a Sport Scholar. He enjoys Biology and Geography. He swims at Ashford School with Jacob. He is also really good at Biology and enjoys various other subjects. Jacob and Will both created the idea for THE CATALYST during a Biology project, studying Charles Darwin.)
