/Title (Jacob Navaratne is in Year 9 at Ashford School and he, and William Rees founded The Catalyst. Jacob joined Ashford School at the start of the Spring Term in Year 8. He enjoys Computer Science, Maths and Physics. He is also an Academic Scholar and really enjoys swimming - like William. He has a brother in the Prep School and is very good friends with both Will and Zach. Jacob and Will both created the idea for THE CATALYST during a Biology project, studying Charles Darwin.)
