/Title (Their experiment focused on how certain chemicals react in microgravity. They tested different materials and solutions on Earth first, checking that they were stable inside the stainless steel containers used on the Shuttle. To run everything in orbit, the team even built their own miniature computer using a 65C102 microprocessor, which controlled the experiment and recorded its results.)
